<title>UK: SOCCER-GINOLA FACT FILE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GINOLA FACT FILE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fact file on David Ginola who joined Tottenham Hotspur from Newcastle on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Born: January 25, 1967 in Gossin, France</p>
<p>Height/weight: 1.80 metres/75 kg</p>
<p>1985 - Joins Toulon</p>
<p>1988 - Joins Racing Paris</p>
<p>1990 - Joins Brest</p>
<p>1992 - Joins Paris St Germain</p>
<p>1994 - PSG win first league championship in eight years. Named French Player of the Year and French Players' Player of the Year</p>
<p>1995 - Transferred to Newcastle for $2.5 million</p>
<p>1996 - Newcastle second in English league</p>
<p>1997 - Newcastle league runners-up again.</p>
<p>1997 - Signs for Tottenham.</p>
<p>Caps: 16</p>
</text>
